abstract: >-
  A specialized CKKS scoring experiment with public queries, a prepared encrypted
  database, native CPU and optional CUDA evaluation, native client decoding,
  historical GPU measurements, fresh CPU validation, and offline evidence checks.
  Developed through an AI-assisted workflow under Erik Groset's project leadership
  and research direction. No general FHE speed, patent novelty or independent
  security certification is claimed.
